sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant UI as Web/Mobile App
    participant CO as Checkout Service
    participant CART as Cart Service
    participant PAY as Payment Service
    participant INV as Inventory Service
    participant FRAUD as Fraud Service
    participant ORD as Order Service
    participant BUS as Event Bus
    participant NOTIF as Notification Service
    participant FUL as Fulfillment Service

    C->>UI: Place Order
    UI->>CO: Submit Checkout Request
    CO->>CART: Validate Cart and Price
    CO->>PAY: Authorize Payment
    CO->>INV: Reserve Inventory
    CO->>FRAUD: Run Critical Fraud Check
    CO->>ORD: Create Durable Order
    ORD-->>CO: Order Confirmed
    CO-->>UI: Confirmation Response
    UI-->>C: Show Confirmation

    ORD->>BUS: OrderConfirmed Event
    BUS->>NOTIF: Send Confirmation
    BUS->>FUL: Start Fulfillment
    BUS->>FRAUD: Run Additional Risk Enrichment
